    <mytitle|Where we are>

    \;

    <with|font-series|bold|Last time.> Positivity of the energy
    <math|\<Rightarrow\>> imaginary time; vacuum expectations are moments of
    <math|\<mu\><around|(|\<mathd\>\<varphi\>|)>*<space|0.17em>`*`="*<space|0.17em>Z<rsup|-1>\<mathe\><rsup|-<big|int><around|[|<frac|1|2>\|\<nabla\>*\<varphi\>\|<rsup|2>+<frac|1|2>*m<rsup|2>*\<varphi\><rsup|2>+V<around|(|\<varphi\>|)>|]>>\<cal-D\>*\<varphi\>>;
    relativistic QFTs <math|\<leftrightarrow\>> measures on
    <math|\<cal-S\><rprime|'><around|(|\<bbb-R\><rsup|d>|)>> satisfying the
    OS axioms.

    <with|font-series|bold|Today.> The Gaussian part, rigorously.

    <\enumerate>
      <item>Construction on <math|\<bbb-T\><rsup|d>> and
      <math|\<bbb-R\><rsup|d>>; regularity.

      <item>Reflection positivity; the free field; Källén\ULehmann again.

      <item>Local operators: Wick powers.

      <item>Gaussian integration by parts: the Dyson\USchwinger (DS)
      equation.

      <item><strong|DS characterises the GFF.>

      <item><strong|The GFF is the stationary marginal of parabolic and
      elliptic stochastic quantisation.>
    </enumerate>
  </hidden>|<\hidden>
